  "description": "YUXPOY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H102 N6 Nd4 O34,6(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.514-3.832 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.62-103.37°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(HL)2(H3L)2(H2L')2(PhCOO)2]·6CH3OH.",
